    <div class="hero-box">
      <p><strong>Executive Overview:</strong> The <strong>Arroyo Grand Nationals</strong> is the flagship grassroots drift competition series organized by <strong>Mid Michigan Drift Club (MMDC)</strong>[cite: 1, 2]. Operating out of <strong>Jackson Speedway</strong> (3363 Page Ave, Jackson, MI) since 2022, MMDC is led by veteran drivers with over 10 years of motorsport experience[cite: 1, 2]. Driven by a reinvestment model where 100% of event proceeds go back into track upgrades and community growth, MMDC provides a direct pipeline for brand partners to connect with thousands of active automotive enthusiasts[cite: 1, 2].</p>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Competition Format &amp; Technical Philosophy</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="col-half">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Equalized Spec "Party Tire" Standard</strong>
          <ul>
            <li><span>Limits drivers to budget-friendly, max 235-width street radials (Arroyo Grand Sport A/S, American Roadstar Sport A/S, Fullway HP108).</span></li>
            <li><span>Equalizes driver horsepower and build budgets across the field.</span></li>
            <li><span>Delivers high-duration, high-smoke, door-to-door tandem action!</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-half">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>High-Stakes Bracket Architecture</strong>
          <ul>
            <li><span>Capped driver fields featuring two complete Top 16 tandem competition brackets in a single day.</span></li>
            <li><span>Flexible qualifying runs integrated with open practice sessions.</span></li>
            <li><span>Ends with high-octane open tandem jam sessions for maximum track time.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>2. MMDC Signature Event Ecosystem</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="col-half">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Driver Advancement Days (D.A.D.)</strong>
          <ul>
            <li><span>Relaxed, focused skill-building clinics for grassroots drivers[cite: 2].</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Nightshift</strong>
          <ul>
            <li><span>Team-focused night drifting emphasizing style, liveries, and team tandem[cite: 2].</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-half">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Matsuri</strong>
          <ul>
            <li><span>2-day drift festival featuring callout-style tandem competitions[cite: 2].</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Double Time &amp; Ladies Drift Days</strong>
          <ul>
            <li><span>High-intensity lap exhibitions and coaching clinics for female drivers[cite: 2].</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

